  "bio": "Adrian Gibson, based in Quito, Ecuador, is an extraordinary tattoo artist skilled in the intricate styles of fineline and dotwork. His proficiency isn't limited to tattooing, boasting a varied range of talents such as being a Sci-fi writer, podcaster, illustrator, book blogger, and producer. Adrian's clients have always appreciated his professionalism that goes hand in hand with his deft artistic abilities.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Quito, Pichincha, Ecuador\n\nAward-winning SFF author 🍄 Creator/co-host of @sffaddictspod 🍄‍🟫 Book designer 🍄 #SPFBOX 2nd Place 🍄‍🟫 #MushroomBlues available in ALL FORMATS 🍄",
